  "solution": {
    "text": "Volume of cone<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>πr</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></math><br /><br />Mass of cone,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ρ</mi><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>πr</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></math><br /><br />Mass of hemisphere, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ρ</mi><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>πr</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></math><br /><br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ρ</mi><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>πr</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></math><br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/120444-1.JPG\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 263px;\" /><br /><br />Now,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ρ</mi><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>πr</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>πr</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mn>8</mn></mfrac><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ρ</mi><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>πr</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ρ</mi><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>πr</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ρ</mi><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>πr</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mn>8</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mtext> </mtext></math> or&nbsp; <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></math>",
